<h2>I'm a learning technology specialist in Auburn, Maine.</h2>
<ul class="home-text-list">
    <li>I enjoy working on complex problems and engaging in the creative process, as well as making computer systems
        work more effectively for the people using them.
    </li>
    <li>It's my belief that technology should be centered on user value&mdash; a model that by-and-large tech companies
        have turned away from.
    </li>
    <li>In my role as a learning technology support specialist, I'm proudest of the projects I lead to implement Kaltura
        as a video solution for my institution and Accredible as the badging solution. Both of these projects identified
        a problem for users and implemented solutions that lowered barriers to entry.
    </li>
    <li>I hold a B.S. in Business Administration and an A.S. in Information Technology from Southern New Hampshire
        University.
    </li>
</ul>
